  "question": {
    "text": "The de-Broglie wavelength of an electron, <math><mi>α</mi></math>- particle and proton all having the same kinetic energy is respectively given as <math><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math> Then which of the following is not true?",
    "image": null
  },
